    {
      "title": "Workspaces (monorepo)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A workspace is multiple packages in one repo sharing one uv.lock and one",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#workspaces-monorepo",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": ".venv, each with its own pyproject.toml. Inspired by Cargo workspaces.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#workspaces-monorepo",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Members are addressed with uv run --package <member> / uv add --package <member> <dep>.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#workspaces-monorepo",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "workspace = true sources are treated as editable - cross-package edits are live.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#workspaces-monorepo",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Root [tool.uv.sources] apply to all members unless a member overrides them.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#workspaces-monorepo",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Use a workspace when packages are co-released and tightly coupled; use",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#workspaces-monorepo",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "separate projects (path/git sources) when versions must diverge or a member",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#workspaces-monorepo",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "needs a conflicting dependency (a single shared lock forbids conflicts).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#workspaces-monorepo",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2. The universal lockfile (`uv.lock`)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "uv.lock is a universal (cross-platform) resolution: one lockfile valid for",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "every OS, architecture, and Python version inside the project's requires-python",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "range. A package can appear multiple times with different versions/URLs gated by",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "environment markers (sys_platform, python_full_version, etc.); the marker",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "chooses which entry installs on a given machine.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Resolution knobs (also valid in the pip interface):",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "--resolution {highest|lowest|lowest-direct} (env UV_RESOLUTION). lowest",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "is for testing your declared lower bounds; lowest-direct lowers your direct",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "deps but keeps transitive at highest.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "--prerelease {disallow|allow|if-necessary|explicit|if-necessary-or-explicit}.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "--fork-strategy {requires-python|fewest} - requires-python (default) picks",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "the latest version compatible with each supported Python minor; fewest",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "minimizes the number of distinct versions.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "requires-python semantics: uv considers only lower bounds of dependency",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "requires-python and ignores upper bounds (>=3.8,<4 is treated as >=3.8),",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "because honoring upper bounds causes pathological backtracking. Your project's",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "requires-python must be a subset of every dependency's range.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Export / interop - uv.lock is uv-native; export to standard formats for",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "uv reads pylock.toml (PEP 751) for install but keeps uv.lock as its",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "native format because PEP 751 doesn't yet capture everything uv needs (e.g. full",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "fork/marker model). Treat uv.lock as the source of truth and pylock.toml/",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "requirements.txt as generated artifacts.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "uv.lock is deterministic and committed. The cross-platform guarantee is",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "the headline benefit over a platform-specific pip-compile requirements.txt.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#2-the-universal-lockfile-uvlock",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. Python version install & pinning",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "uv downloads and manages standalone CPython/PyPy builds (python-build-standalone)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "— no pyenv needed, and no system Python required.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Selection & preference:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Request syntax: 3.12, cpython@3.12, pypy@3.10, >=3.11,<3.13, or a path.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": ".python-version (project) / .python-versions pins the interpreter; requires-python",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "in pyproject.toml bounds what is acceptable.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "--python-preference {only-managed|managed|system|only-system} (`[tool.uv]",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "python-preference) controls managed-vs-system priority. managed` (default)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "prefers uv's downloads but will use a compatible system Python.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "--no-python-downloads (env UV_PYTHON_DOWNLOADS=never) forbids auto-download",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "— useful in locked-down CI/containers.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Automatic downloads: uvx python@3.12 -c ... or uv venv will fetch a missing",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "interpreter on demand unless downloads are disabled.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#3-python-version-install-pinning",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "4. Tool / pipx replacement (`uv tool`, `uvx`)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "uv runs and installs CLI tools from Python packages in isolated environments,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#4-tool-pipx-replacement-uv-tool-uvx",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "uvx = uv tool run: an ephemeral environment, ideal for one-off or",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#4-tool-pipx-replacement-uv-tool-uvx",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "CI invocations; it caches the env so repeat runs are fast.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#4-tool-pipx-replacement-uv-tool-uvx",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "uv tool install is persistent: executables are symlinked (copied on",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#4-tool-pipx-replacement-uv-tool-uvx",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Windows) into the tool bin dir. Only the package's own entry points are",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#4-tool-pipx-replacement-uv-tool-uvx",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "exposed - not its dependencies' executables.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#4-tool-pipx-replacement-uv-tool-uvx",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "If the bin dir isn't on PATH, uv warns; run uv tool update-shell.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#4-tool-pipx-replacement-uv-tool-uvx",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "5. pip-compatible interface (`uv pip`)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A near-drop-in, much faster reimplementation of the pip / pip-tools workflow.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Operates imperatively on an environment with **no lockfile and no automatic",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "project management** - use it for legacy flows, scripts, containers, or when you",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "explicitly want pip semantics.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Deliberate differences from pip (uv is stricter / more correct by default):",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "uv pip install does not mutate a global Python unless you pass --system",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "or activate a venv; otherwise it targets .venv.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "uv pip compile --universal produces one marker-annotated requirements.txt",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "valid across platforms - the pip-tools world's per-platform lock pain solved.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "uv pip sync is destructive-to-match (like pip-sync): it uninstalls anything",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "not in the file. Use it for reproducible CI/containers.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Resolution flags (--resolution, --prerelease, --index, --index-strategy)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "match the project interface.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#5-pip-compatible-interface-uv-pip",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Build backend, publishing & PEP 723 scripts",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Build backend. Since mid-2025 uv init --package/--lib default to uv's own",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#build-backend-publishing-pep-723-scripts",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "PEP 517 backend uv_build (package uv-build), zero-config for pure-Python",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#build-backend-publishing-pep-723-scripts",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "projects; Hatchling remains a fine alternative for projects needing plugins or",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#build-backend-publishing-pep-723-scripts",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "PEP 723 inline-script metadata - single-file scripts declare their own deps",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#build-backend-publishing-pep-723-scripts",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "and Python, run in an isolated ephemeral env:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#build-backend-publishing-pep-723-scripts",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Configuration & cache",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Config files: [tool.uv] in pyproject.toml (project), or a standalone",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#configuration-cache",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "uv.toml (project or ~/.config/uv/uv.toml global). uv.toml wins over",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#configuration-cache",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "[tool.uv] when both exist.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#configuration-cache",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Env vars: almost every flag has one - UV_RESOLUTION, UV_PRERELEASE,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#configuration-cache",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "UV_PYTHON, UV_PYTHON_DOWNLOADS, UV_INDEX/UV_DEFAULT_INDEX,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#configuration-cache",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "UV_CACHE_DIR, UV_NO_CACHE, UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT, UV_SYSTEM_PYTHON.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#configuration-cache",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Indexes: [[tool.uv.index]] (name + url, optional default/explicit),",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#configuration-cache",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "--index/--default-index, --index-strategy {first-index|unsafe-first-match|unsafe-best-match}.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#configuration-cache",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Cache: global content-addressed store with hardlinks into venvs (why uv is",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#configuration-cache",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "fast and disk-light). uv cache dir / uv cache clean / uv cache prune",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#configuration-cache",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "(--ci prunes safely for caching layers). --no-cache / UV_NO_CACHE for",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#configuration-cache",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Practical patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Adopt incrementally: start with uv pip install -r requirements.txt /",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "uv venv (drop-in), then migrate to uv init + uv add + uv.lock when ready.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Reproducible CI: uv sync --locked (or uv lock --check as a gate) so a",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "stale lockfile fails the build instead of silently re-resolving.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Docker: copy pyproject.toml + uv.lock first, `uv sync --no-install-project",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "--frozen for a cacheable deps layer, then copy source and uv sync --frozen`.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Use the ghcr.io/astral-sh/uv image or COPY --from=ghcr.io/astral-sh/uv /uv /uv.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Set UV_COMPILE_BYTECODE=1, UV_LINK_MODE=copy in containers.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "GitHub Actions: astral-sh/setup-uv@v5 installs uv and caches automatically;",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "combine with uv python install.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Monorepo: one workspace + one uv.lock; per-service deploys via",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "uv sync --package <svc> or uv export --package <svc>.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pin Python per project: uv python pin 3.12 so contributors and CI agree.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#practical-patterns",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Anti-patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Mixing interfaces on one env expecting managed state - uv pip install",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "into a project .venv then uv sync will reconcile to the lock and remove",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "your manual installs. Pick the project interface or the pip interface.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Hand-editing uv.lock - it's generated; edit pyproject.toml and re-lock.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Committing requirements.txt as the source of truth in a uv project - the",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "lock is uv.lock; export requirements.txt as a derived artifact.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Putting dev tools in [project.dependencies] - use [dependency-groups]",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "(uv add --dev) so they don't ship to consumers.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "A workspace with conflicting dependency versions across members - a single",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "shared lock can't satisfy a true conflict; split into separate projects with",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "path/git sources instead.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "uv pip install without --system inside a container and then wondering",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "why the system interpreter is empty - in containers you usually want --system",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "or an explicitly created venv on PATH.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Forgetting requires-python is a subset constraint - if your floor is",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": ">=3.8 but a dependency dropped 3.8, universal resolution fails; raise your",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "floor or constrain the dep.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Troubleshooting",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "\"No interpreter found for Python 3.x\" → uv python install 3.x, or you set",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "--no-python-downloads/UV_PYTHON_DOWNLOADS=never in a locked env.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Lockfile out of date in CI (uv sync --locked fails) → run uv lock",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "locally and commit; something changed pyproject.toml without re-locking.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Tool executable not on PATH\" after uv tool install → uv tool update-shell",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "then restart the shell; verify with uv tool dir --bin.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Resolution is \"too constrained\"/conflict → check overlapping requires-python,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "try --resolution lowest-direct to isolate, or uv tree --invert <pkg> to see",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Editable workspace dep not picking up changes → confirm the member is in",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "[tool.uv.workspace] members and referenced with { workspace = true } in",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "[tool.uv.sources]; re-run uv sync.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Private index auth → uv auth or UV_INDEX_<NAME>_USERNAME/PASSWORD; set",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "--index-strategy if a package exists on multiple indexes.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/uv-python-toolchain/#troubleshooting",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
